{%- comment -%}
  A fresh high-entropy opaque credential: `<prefix>` + 64 hex chars (2 × UUIDv4 =
  244 random bits). Only its sha256 digest is ever persisted.

  @param {string} prefix - e.g. 'mcp_at_', 'mcp_rt_', 'mcp_ac_'
  @return {string}
{%- endcomment -%}
{% liquid
  assign u1 = '' | uuid | replace: '-', ''
  assign u2 = '' | uuid | replace: '-', ''
  assign raw = prefix | append: u1 | append: u2
  return raw
%}
